            "review_title": "Review at The Pizza Company",
            "review_text": "Srirambalaji S\nChennai (Madras), India109 contributions\n1\nGreat Surprise Veg Pizza\nNov 2019\nOn late & hungry evening from office, just saw this place round the corner behind the office and gave a try. They have a wide variety of Pizza, Pasta, Salads and deserts (juices, coolers & sodas) to choose from. But options are very less for a vegetarian with standard veg salad & veg pizza. There are also combo options of pizza + starter (french fries or non-veg items) + pepsi / coke tin which is a value for money. Overall the price is costlier but the pizza had a refreshing taste compared to the other pizza places.\nOne must try this place when in Hanoi, Vietnam.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 21, 2019",
            "rating": 2.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
