            "review_title": "Review at The Pizza Company",
            "review_text": "TravelinGypsey\n305 contributions\n0\nDecent Pizza\nNov 2019 • Solo\nI ordered a medium pepperoni and cheese pizza with deep dish crust. Great size, would feed two people easily (about 3 slices each 6/7 slices depending on how they cut it. It wasn’t bad but wasn’t necessarily satisfactory either. Crust was great but the overall pizza wasn’t up to great pizza standards in my opinion; that being cheesy with fresh ingredients and a flavorful sauce. I would recommend this place for a basic pizza if there isn’t another option around. Price was about 160,000 which is about $7 usd so not too bad but there are better options for pizza at that price! \nFollow me on Instagram @travelingypsey \nFor pictures, places to visit and tips! Feel free to message me also! \nSafe Travels!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 2, 2019",
